1
00:00:00,019 --> 00:00:02,399
(Leonard:)Not heavy ones.

2
00:00:02,563 --> 00:00:06,443
It's startling you haven't considered
a Lorentz invariant or field theory approach.

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,990
(Sheldon:)You think I haven't considered it?

4
00:00:09,153 --> 00:00:12,403
(Sheldon:)- You really think I haven't considered it?
- Have you considered it?

5
00:00:14,116 --> 00:00:16,206
- Get him out, Leonard.
- Come on, Dennis.

6
00:00:16,369 --> 00:00:19,159
(Leonard:)I'll show you the radiation lab.

7
00:00:19,497 --> 00:00:21,627
Wow. You won the Stevenson Award?

8
00:00:21,999 --> 00:00:25,879
(Sheldon:)Yes. In fact,
I am the youngest person ever to win it.

9
00:00:26,254 --> 00:00:28,384
Really? How old?

10
00:00:28,547 --> 00:00:29,877
(Sheldon:)Fourteen and a half.

11
00:00:30,049 --> 00:00:32,179
Mm. You were the youngest
ever to win it.

12
00:00:36,013 --> 00:00:38,473
(Leonard:)It's like looking
into an obnoxious mirror, isn't it?

13
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:46,440
(Penny(to Raj):)Mm. This is really delicious, isn't it?

14
00:00:49,527 --> 00:00:52,817
(Penny(to Raj):)Still can't talk to me
unless you're drunk, huh?

15
00:00:53,781 --> 00:00:57,951
(Penny(to Raj):)Oh, sweetie, you are so damaged.

16
00:00:58,911 --> 00:01:01,581
(Howard:)Hey, I'm damaged too.

